  "body": "Part of #361. The GUI side of tool bodies:\n- in the tool editor, pick the tip point and the axis on the imported body;\n- draw the real body in the viewport and the simulation instead of the cylinders.\n\nShares data with #93 (the spun holder-profile editor), which uses the same revolved envelope.\n\n**Done means:** a user can import, align and see a vendor holder without typing offsets; a UI test covers the editor flow.\n",
